nd, applied, plan age,&lt;br&gt;the supervisor's reasons" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1090" y="315" width="310" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c40" value="&lt;b&gt;Metrics&lt;/b&gt; (simulator only) → evaluate&lt;br&gt;rms / max off the centreline, off-road %,&lt;br&gt;laps, collisions, seconds per safety rule" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1090" y="405" width="310" height="75" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c41" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#555555;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontFamily=Helvetica;jumpStyle=arc;jumpSize=8;dashed=1;strokeColor=#999999;exitX=1;exitY=0.3;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c22" target="c38"><mxGeometry x="0" relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c42" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#555555;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontFamily=Helvetica;jumpStyle=arc;jumpSize=8;dashed=1;strokeColor=#999999;exitX=1;exitY=0.2;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c23" target="c39"><mxGeometry x="0" relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c43" value="&lt;b&gt;Rates and the rule they imply&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;control loop: 50 Hz (20 ms)&lt;br&gt;camera over ROS 2: 25 Hz&lt;br&gt;SmolVLA on the laptop: one chunk per 125–190 ms&lt;br&gt;chunk: 16 × 0.1 s = 1.5 s ahead&lt;br&gt;plan age sweeps [L, 2L): the 0.6 s watchdog&lt;br&gt;needs L &amp;lt; 0.3 s&lt;br&gt;teacher at 1.5 m/s: unstable past ≈ 250 ms" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Helvetica;shape=note;size=14;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#999999;align=left;spacingLeft=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1070" y="530" width="350" height="190" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram id="page2" name="3 · SmolVLA model (smolvla-v1)"><mxGraphModel dx="1600" dy="1000" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1820" pageHeight="1040" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="c1" value="&lt;b&gt;SmolVLA&lt;/b&gt; as fine-tuned here (smolvla-v1) · 450 M parameters · a VLA = a VLM + an action expert" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=20;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="15" width="1400" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c2" value="&lt;b&gt;Legend&lt;/b&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1130" y="825" width="80" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c3" value="frozen: pre-trained weights, unchanged" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1130" y="851" width="300" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c4" value="trained in the fine-tune (100 M)" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1130" y="887" width="300" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c5" value="pre / post-processing, saved with the checkpoint" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1130" y="923" width="300" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c6" valu